{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-architecture-and-operation","title":"电网架构与运行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-architecture-and-operation","wordCount":2537,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"电网架构与运行\">电网架构与运行</h1><p>把发电厂的电送到你家插座，中间隔着一条横跨上千公里、电压被反复抬高再压低的物理链路。这条链路必须时时刻刻让&quot;发出来的功率&quot;等于&quot;用掉的功率&quot;——误差大到让频率偏离 50 Hz（中国、欧洲）或 60 Hz（北美）几百毫赫兹，就会触发保护跳闸，进而级联停电。电网就是为了维持这个秒级、毫秒级的实时平衡而建造的庞大机器，它没有&quot;缓冲库存&quot;，电几乎不能大规模储存。理解它的分层架构和运行控制逻辑，是理解储能为什么会成为新型电力系统刚需的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电力系统按电压等级分成三个物理段：发电、输电、配电。发电机出口电压通常只有十几到二十几千伏，升压变压器把它抬到 220 kV、500 kV 乃至 ±800 kV 的特高压去远距离输送，到了负荷中心再逐级降压，最后由配电变压器降到 220/380 V 进入终端。电压抬得越高，相同功率下电流越小，线路 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2 R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 损耗就越低——这是整个分层架构的物理动机：损耗正比于电流平方，把电压翻一倍、电流减半，线损降到四分之一。</p>\n<p>按 <a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/grids\">IEA《Electricity 2026》</a> 的口径，全球电网总投资仍约 4000 亿美元/年，而要支撑 2026–2030 年间年均 3.6% 的电力需求增长（约为过去十年增速的 1.5 倍），到 2030 年电网年投资需提高约 50%。美国仅高压（&gt;34 kV）输电线路就超过 64.2 万英里（约 103 万公里），2024 年输电资本开支 350 亿美元、配电 600 亿美元（<a href=\"https://institute.bankofamerica.com/content/dam/transformation/us-electrical-grid.pdf\">美国银行 Transformation Institute</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[发电厂&lt;br/&gt;10-25 kV] --&gt;|升压变压器| B[特高压输电&lt;br/&gt;500 kV / 800 kV&lt;br/&gt;HVDC ±800 kV]&#10;    B --&gt; C[区域变电站&lt;br/&gt;降压至 220 kV]&#10;    C --&gt; D[次输电网&lt;br/&gt;110 / 66 kV]&#10;    D --&gt; E[配电变电站&lt;br/&gt;降压至 10 / 20 kV]&#10;    E --&gt; F[配电变压器&lt;br/&gt;降至 220 / 380 V]&#10;    F --&gt; G[终端负荷&lt;br/&gt;家庭 工商业]&#10;    H[分布式光伏 储能 EV&lt;br/&gt;DER] --&gt;|双向潮流| E&#10;    H --&gt;|双向潮流| F\">flowchart TD\n    A[发电厂&lt;br/&gt;10-25 kV] --&gt;|升压变压器| B[特高压输电&lt;br/&gt;500 kV / 800 kV&lt;br/&gt;HVDC ±800 kV]\n    B --&gt; C[区域变电站&lt;br/&gt;降压至 220 kV]\n    C --&gt; D[次输电网&lt;br/&gt;110 / 66 kV]\n    D --&gt; E[配电变电站&lt;br/&gt;降压至 10 / 20 kV]\n    E --&gt; F[配电变压器&lt;br/&gt;降至 220 / 380 V]\n    F --&gt; G[终端负荷&lt;br/&gt;家庭 工商业]\n    H[分布式光伏 储能 EV&lt;br/&gt;DER] --&gt;|双向潮流| E\n    H --&gt;|双向潮流| F</pre><p>下表对比三个物理段的典型特征。注意配电段在 2026 年正从&quot;单向放射状&quot;被改造成&quot;双向、可观可控&quot;，这是分布式能源（DER）渗透带来的结构性变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>典型电压</th>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th>潮流方向</th>\n<th>2026 年关键变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发电</td>\n<td>10–25 kV 出口</td>\n<td>集中式为主</td>\n<td>流出</td>\n<td>同步机占比下降，逆变器电源（IBR）增多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输电</td>\n<td>220 kV–±800 kV</td>\n<td>环网/网格状</td>\n<td>双向、可调度</td>\n<td>HVDC 扩张，跨区互联送可再生能源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配电</td>\n<td>10–20 kV / 0.4 kV</td>\n<td>放射状为主</td>\n<td>由单向转双向</td>\n<td>DER、储能、EV 接入，需 ADMS/DERMS 管控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时功率平衡与频率控制\">实时功率平衡与频率控制</h2><p>电网频率是&quot;发电与用电是否平衡&quot;的全局信号。负荷突然增加而发电没跟上，旋转的同步发电机组就被&quot;拖慢&quot;，频率下降；反之上升。这个物理量在全网每一点几乎一致，所以它是最廉价的协调媒介。控制系统据此分三层逐级把频率拉回额定值（参考 <a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/strengthening-power-system-security-in-kyrgyzstan-a-roadmap/power-system-security-concepts-and-principles\">IEA 电力系统安全原则</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.nerc.com/globalassets/who-we-are/standing-committees/rstc/rs/primary_frequency_control_reliability_guideline_v_4.0_clean_v3---dr.pdf\">NERC 一次调频指南</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一次调频（秒级，去中心化）</strong>：机组调速器按本地频率偏差做比例反馈，自动增减出力，几秒内遏制频率跌落。它只&quot;止跌&quot;，不会把频率拉回 50 Hz，会留下静态偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>二次调频（分钟级，AGC）</strong>：自动发电控制（Automatic Generation Control）在控制区层面消除发电-负荷失配，把频率和区域间联络线交换功率拉回计划值，消除一次调频残留的偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>三次调频（5–10 分钟，经济调度）</strong>：通过经济调度或最优潮流（OPF）求解全局约束优化，重新分配机组出力点，在保证安全的前提下让总发电成本最低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>频率变化的快慢由系统惯量决定。同步发电机的转动质量储存动能，扰动瞬间自动释放，天然抑制频率突变。惯量越大，频率变化率（RoCoF, Rate of Change of Frequency）越小。摆动方程刻画了这个关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi></mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2H}{f_0}\\frac{df}{dt} = P_m - P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是惯性常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是额定频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_m - P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是机械功率与电磁功率之差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 因同步机退役而下降，同样的功率不平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_m - P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会产生更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">df/dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>——这正是高比例可再生能源电网面临的核心难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高比例可再生能源带来的运行挑战\">高比例可再生能源带来的运行挑战</h2><p>风电和光伏通过电力电子变流器并网，与系统在电气上&quot;解耦&quot;，本身不提供转动惯量。研究显示，高风光渗透会让系统的转动惯量相比传统电网下降 40%–70%，放大功率失配时的频率波动（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-024-58189-2\">Nature《Scientific Reports》</a>）。光伏更是几乎不提供任何惯量。叠加风光出力随天气剧烈起伏，supply-demand 的瞬时缺口被同时&quot;放大&quot;且&quot;频繁化&quot;。</p>\n<p>2026 年的主流应对是用控制策略把变流器伪装成同步机：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>构网型逆变器（Grid-Forming Inverter, GFM）</strong>：不同于跟网型（grid-following）逆变器只跟随既有电压相位，构网型自己建立电压和频率参考，行为接近同步发电机，能提供合成惯量、做故障穿越，甚至支撑黑启动（<a href=\"https://gridtechpedia.inl.gov/technology/grid-forming-inverters/\">INL GridTechPedia</a>、<a href=\"https://www.osti.gov/servlets/purl/2217359\">PNNL IBR 概览</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>标准约束</strong>：<a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/2800a/12386/\">IEEE 2800-2022</a> 规定了接入输电及次输电系统的逆变器电源（IBR）最低互联与性能要求，其修订版 2800a 专门降低构网型设备接入的技术壁垒，把频率控制、RoCoF 容忍度、故障穿越等指标写成可考核条款。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[功率失配出现] --&gt; B{系统惯量充足?}&#10;    B --&gt;|同步机为主 高惯量| C[RoCoF 小&lt;br/&gt;一次调频从容响应]&#10;    B --&gt;|高风光 低惯量| D[RoCoF 大&lt;br/&gt;频率快速跌落]&#10;    D --&gt; E[合成惯量 / 构网型逆变器]&#10;    D --&gt; F[储能毫秒级调频]&#10;    E --&gt; G[频率恢复至额定]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[功率失配出现] --&gt; B{系统惯量充足?}\n    B --&gt;|同步机为主 高惯量| C[RoCoF 小&lt;br/&gt;一次调频从容响应]\n    B --&gt;|高风光 低惯量| D[RoCoF 大&lt;br/&gt;频率快速跌落]\n    D --&gt; E[合成惯量 / 构网型逆变器]\n    D --&gt; F[储能毫秒级调频]\n    E --&gt; G[频率恢复至额定]\n    F --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; G</pre><p>可以看到，储能（尤其电池）凭借毫秒级响应，天然适合补上消失的一次调频和惯量——这是电网架构演进把储能推向中心的运行逻辑，也是本 hub 后续章节的主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可靠性准则-n-1-安全与调度\">可靠性准则：N-1 安全与调度</h2><p>电网不能赌&quot;什么都不坏&quot;。运行的底线准则是 <strong>N-1 安全</strong>：系统在任意单一元件（一条线路、一台发电机或一台变压器）非计划退出后，仍能维持正常运行、满足全部负荷、保持稳定。按 <a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/strengthening-power-system-security-in-kyrgyzstan-a-roadmap/power-system-security-concepts-and-principles\">NERC TPL 标准</a>，N-1 事件下系统必须稳定且满足所有需求。调度运行因此始终留有备用容量，并把约束写进优化问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_i C_i(P_i) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_i P_i = P_D + P_{loss},\\ P_i^{\\min} \\le P_i \\le P_i^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1275em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8805em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是经济调度的基本形式——在满足功率平衡和机组出力上下限约束下最小化总发电成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i C_i(P_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当再叠加每条线路在任一 N-1 故障后都不能过载的约束，就成了安全约束机组组合（SCUC）/最优潮流（SCOPF）。这类优化每隔几分钟到几小时在调度中心滚动求解。</p>\n<p>调度的&quot;眼睛和手&quot;是一整套监控系统。能量管理系统（EMS）管输电网，配电管理系统正升级为高级配电管理系统（ADMS），叠加分布式能源管理系统（DERMS）来协调海量 DER（<a href=\"https://www.nlr.gov/grid/advanced-distribution-management\">NREL 高级配电管理</a>）。它们都建立在 SCADA 数据采集之上。下表对比这三层运行系统的职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>管辖范围</th>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n<th>核心功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SCADA</td>\n<td>全网测点</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>遥测、遥信、遥控数据采集与监视</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMS</td>\n<td>输电网</td>\n<td>秒到分钟</td>\n<td>状态估计、AGC、经济调度、安全分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADMS / DERMS</td>\n<td>配电网与 DER</td>\n<td>秒到分钟</td>\n<td>馈线管理、电压无功优化、DER 聚合调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"需求侧的结构性变化-负荷不再被动\">需求侧的结构性变化：负荷不再被动</h2><p>过去配电网是单向放射状，潮流从变电站流向用户。2026 年这个假设被两件事打破。其一是分布式能源的爆发：<a href=\"https://www.pew.org/en/research-and-analysis/reports/2026/04/distributed-energy-can-unleash-the-resilient-affordable-grid-of-the-future\">Pew 研究</a> 预测美国 2024–2028 年将新增 217 GW 分布式能源资源容量，屋顶光伏在中午把潮流&quot;倒灌&quot;回电网，配电网必须从单向变双向、从&quot;盲调&quot;变可观可控。</p>\n<p>其二是数据中心带来的集中式新增负荷。<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/demand\">IEA《Electricity 2026》需求篇</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/energy-and-ai/energy-demand-from-ai\">IEA《Energy and AI》</a> 指出，全球数据中心用电 2025 年增长 17%，其中 AI 数据中心激增约 50%，数据中心整体到 2030 年贡献全球电力需求增量的约十分之一，在发达经济体则超过 20%。它们高度集中在少数地点，使得局部接入和电网增容比&quot;分散增长&quot;棘手得多——据估计若风险不解，约 20% 的在建数据中心项目可能因电网瓶颈而延期。</p>\n<p>这两股力量从相反方向重塑负荷曲线：DER 让净负荷在白天被压低（著名的&quot;鸭子曲线&quot;），数据中心则在基荷上叠加巨大且近乎刚性的增量。两者都加剧了供需的时空错配，让&quot;实时平衡&quot;这个老问题在新尺度上重新尖锐——这正是储能、需求响应和电网灵活性资源的用武之地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电网按发电、输电、配电分层，逐级升降压的根本动机是用高电压压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 线损；输电段已网格化、HVDC 化，配电段正从单向放射状转为双向可控。</li>\n<li>电没有库存，运行的本质是秒级、毫秒级的实时功率平衡；频率是全网平衡信号，靠一次（秒）、二次 AGC（分钟）、三次经济调度（5–10 分钟）三层控制维持。</li>\n<li>惯量决定频率变化率 RoCoF，由摆动方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi></mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2H}{f_0}\\frac{df}{dt}=P_m-P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4133em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 刻画；同步机退役使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 下降，高风光电网惯量降 40%–70%，频率更易剧烈波动。</li>\n<li>2026 年的应对是构网型逆变器（IEEE 2800/2800a）提供合成惯量，以及储能的毫秒级调频——这把储能从&quot;可选项&quot;推成新型电力系统的刚需。</li>\n<li>运行底线是 N-1 安全准则，落地为安全约束下的经济调度/最优潮流，由 SCADA + EMS + ADMS/DERMS 这套监控调度体系执行。</li>\n<li>需求侧正被分布式能源（美国 2024–2028 拟增 217 GW DER）与 AI 数据中心（2025 年用电 +17%，AI 数据中心 +50%）从两个方向重塑，加剧时空错配，使灵活性资源成为电网的核心议题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电网架构与运行","id":"电网架构与运行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实时功率平衡与频率控制","id":"实时功率平衡与频率控制"},{"level":2,"text":"高比例可再生能源带来的运行挑战","id":"高比例可再生能源带来的运行挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"可靠性准则：N-1 安全与调度","id":"可靠性准则-n-1-安全与调度"},{"level":2,"text":"需求侧的结构性变化：负荷不再被动","id":"需求侧的结构性变化-负荷不再被动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"频率与电压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/frequency-and-voltage-control"}}